2Sa 5:1 , The tribes come to Hebron and anoint David over Israel;
2Sa 5:4 , David's age;
2Sa 5:6 , He taking Zion from the Jebusites, dwells in it;
2Sa 5:11 , Hiram sends to David;
2Sa 5:13 , Eleven sons are born to him in Jerusalem;
2Sa 5:17 , David, directed by God, smites the Philistines at Baal-perazim;
2Sa 5:22 , and again at the mulberry trees.
